00:07:10.180 --> 00:07:11.514
Sorry...

00:07:12.933 --> 00:07:16.519
What happened to Koutei and the others?
Are they still on the ship?

00:07:16.519 --> 00:07:21.483
How would | know? Worry about
yourself instead of others.

00:07:21.483 --> 00:07:26.154
Damn... | still can't figure
out what they're thinking.

00:07:28.698 --> 00:07:32.160
That girl who attacked us on the deck...

00:07:33.161 --> 00:07:38.375
I'm posifive she's the girl who was
