00:21:29.705 --> 00:21:33.125
For all eternity, no matter what...

00:21:35.002 --> 00:21:40.007
Chapter 5 "Bonds of the Soul"
The End

00:21:45.888 --> 00:21:48.557
Within the sform that rages now

